# Smuggler's Surprise with all three modes ({G}+{2}+{4}{G}+{1} = nine mana: five Moxen, a Black Lotus and a Plains): "No matter which modes you choose, you always follow the
# instructions in the order they are written" (CR 700.2a). Turn 3: the mill comes first (Alpine Grizzly, Lightning Bolt, Hill Giant and a Plains are milled) and Bot1 takes the Alpine
# Grizzly (power 4) and the Hill Giant (power 3) into its hand; then it puts both onto the battlefield; then creatures with power 4 or greater gain hexproof and indestructible:
